<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CSV Viewer & Editor — DevBox Tools</title>
  <meta name="description" content="View, edit, and export CSV, TSV, and JSON data online.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/csv-viewer/">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="../../assets/img/favicon.ico?v=1">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="../../assets/img/favicon-32x32.png?v=1">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="../../assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=1">
  <link rel="manifest" href="../../manifest.webmanifest">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/csv-viewer/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="CSV Viewer & Editor — DevBox Tools">
  <meta property="og:description" content="View, edit, and export CSV, TSV, and JSON data online.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/assets/img/og-cover.png">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
  <meta name="twitter:url" content="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/csv-viewer/">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="CSV Viewer & Editor — DevBox Tools">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="View, edit, and export CSV, TSV, and JSON data online.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../assets/css/style.css">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
    "name": "CSV Viewer & Editor",
    "description": "View, edit, and export CSV, TSV, and JSON data online.",
    "url": "https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/devbox-tools/tools/csv-viewer/",
    "applicationCategory": "DeveloperApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Any",
    "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "USD" }
  }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a href="../../" class="logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 192 192" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="192" height="192" rx="96" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
          <path d="M58 56L88 88L58 120" stroke="white" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
          <path d="M134 56L104 88L134 120" stroke="white" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        </svg>
        DevBox
      </a>
      <nav>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="../../">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="../../guides/">Guides</a></li>
          <li><a href="../../developers/">Developers</a></li>
          <li><a href="../../donate/">Donate</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <button class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme">🌙</button>
        <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="section-title">CSV Viewer & Editor</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">View, edit, and export CSV, TSV, and JSON data with auto-detection.</p>

      <div class="tool-layout">
        <div class="tool-main">
          <textarea id="csv-input" placeholder="Paste CSV data here, or drag & drop a file..."></textarea>
          <div class="btn-group">
            <button id="btn-render" class="btn">Render Table</button>
            <button id="btn-export-csv" class="btn btn-secondary">Export CSV</button>
            <button id="btn-export-tsv" class="btn btn-secondary">Export TSV</button>
            <button id="btn-export-json" class="btn btn-secondary">Export JSON</button>
            <button id="btn-clear" class="btn btn-error">Clear</button>
          </div>
          <div id="csv-message"></div>
          <div id="csv-table-wrap" style="overflow-x:auto;margin-top:16px;display:none;">
            <table id="csv-table"></table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tool-sidebar">
          <div class="sidebar-card">
            <h4>How it works</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);">Paste CSV data or drag a file. The delimiter is auto-detected.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sidebar-card">
            <h4>Privacy</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);">🔒 Your data never leaves your device.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="related-tools">
        <h3>Need something else?</h3>
        <a href="../../tools/json-formatter/">JSON Formatter (DevBox)</a>
        <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/shiftfile-tools/tools/base64-converter/">Base64 Converter (ShiftFile)</a>
      </section>

      <section class="faq">
        <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <details>
          <summary>Which delimiters are supported?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Comma, semicolon, and tab are automatically detected based on the first line.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Are quoted fields handled?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">Yes, fields enclosed in double quotes are parsed correctly, including escaped quotes.</div>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I edit the table?</summary>
          <div class="faq-body">The table is view-only. Export to CSV/JSON and re-import to make changes.</div>
        </details>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <div class="privacy-bar">🔒 Your data never leaves your device</div>

  <footer>
    <div class="network-links">
      <p>Part of WebTools Network:</p>
      <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/linkqr-tools/">LinkQR Tools — QR & Links</a>
      <a href="https://mohamedelmaz.github.io/shiftfile-tools/">ShiftFile Tools — File Conversion</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="../../assets/js/app.js"></script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/devbox.sdk.js"></script>
  <script src="../../assets/js/tools/csv-viewer.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
